    "url": "articles/xwing-360/index.html",
    "featured": false,
    "date": "2023-09-10",
    "body": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube aligncenter wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<a aria-label=\"Watch Star Wars: X-Wing (360º) on YouTube\" class=\"video-preview\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0RnQJcFm1PM\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Star Wars: X-Wing (360º) video preview\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/archive/youtube/0RnQJcFm1PM.jpg\"/></a>\n</div><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">GLSL Shadertoy Shader</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Following on from my previous post, I have used <a data-id=\"https://shaderboi.net/\" data-type=\"link\" href=\"https://shaderboi.net/\">ShaderBoi</a> to make a 360º YouTube video of my X-Wing shader.  Enjoy!</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The GLSL shader source can be found <a data-type=\"URL\" href=\"https://www.shadertoy.com/view/DtjfRh\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and <a data-id=\"https://www.poshbrolly.net/shader/eh5Sdf45e3PLlXBJ9OyT\" data-type=\"link\" href=\"https://www.poshbrolly.net/shader/whaugbVtqHyVaPgBqdlI\">here</a>.</p>\n"
